WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.250
Pablo has a test on Friday.

2
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:05.350
He wants to say, "I'm
going to study tonight.

3
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:08.770
" He knows the word
for "I study": estudio.

4
00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:12.070
So he writes: Voy a
estudio esta noche.

5
00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:15.830
His friend Lucía writes:
Voy a estudiar esta noche.

6
00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:17.890
The end of the verb is different.

7
00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:19.750
Only one of them is right.

8
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:21.690
Which one, and why?

9
00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:24.950
In this mission, you'll build
the near future from the verb "to

10
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.870
go", and use it to say
"going to" and "will".

11
00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:32.270
Then you'll meet helper
verbs for "can", "want",

12
00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:34.230
"should" and "have to".

13
00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:38.490
Your mission: work out
what comes after voy a.
